Show/hide environment variables needed for every provider OpenAI <pre><code># OpenAI
OPENAI_API_KEY=&lt;your-api-key&gt;
# (optional) OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.6-luna
</code></pre> OpenRouter <pre><code># OpenRouter
AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY=&lt;your-api-key&gt;
AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=&lt;your-endpoint&gt;
AZURE_OPENAI_API_VERSION=&lt;your-api-version&gt;
AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT=&lt;your-model-name&gt;
</code></pre> xAI Grok <pre><code># xAI Grok
XAI_API_KEY=&lt;your-api-key&gt;
# (optional) XAI_MODEL=grok-4.5
</code></pre> Google Gemini <pre><code># Google Gemini
GEMINI_API_KEY=&lt;your-api-key&gt;
# Also: pip install "splitter-mr[multimodal]"
</code></pre> Anthropic (Claude Vision) <pre><code># Anthropic (Claude Vision)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=&lt;your-api-key&gt;
# (optional) ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5
</code></pre> Hugging Face (local/open-source) <pre><code># Hugging Face (optional, only if needed by the model)
HF_ACCESS_TOKEN=&lt;your-hf-token&gt;
# Also: pip install "splitter-mr[multimodal]"
</code></pre>

